:: RobinTemple Journal Widgets [widget]
<<widget 'robin-temple-journal'>>
  <<if $RobinTemple?.stage and $RobinTemple.stage isnot 'none'>>
    <hr>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <h1 class='header gold bold'>Robin and the temple</h1>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <h1 class='header gold bold'>罗宾与神殿</h1>
    <</language>>
    <ul class='journal'>
      <li><<lanSwitch "This path is the mod's own invention. In the base game Robin has no ties to the temple." '罗宾的神殿线是模组的原创内容；原版中罗宾与神殿并无往来。'>></li>
      <<switch $RobinTemple.stage>>
        <<case 'invited'>>
          <li><<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              Robin has questions about joining the temple. Talk in Robin’s room after making your own vow.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              罗宾对加入神殿还有疑问。立下自己的誓言后，去罗宾的房间谈谈。
          <</language>></li>
        <<case 'scheduled'>>
          <li><<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              Jordan will assess Robin on day <span class='gold'><<= $RobinTemple.exam_day>></span>. Before then, find Robin at the orphanage from 17:00 to 19:15 and go to the temple together.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              约旦将在第 <span class='gold'><<= $RobinTemple.exam_day>></span> 天为罗宾主持纯洁试炼。在此之前，17:00 至 19:15 可以去孤儿院找罗宾，一起到神殿准备。
          <</language>></li>
        <<case 'failed'>>
          <li><<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              Robin needs time to decide freely. Ask again in Robin’s room after day <span class='gold'><<= $RobinTemple.exam_day + 7>></span>.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              罗宾需要时间自己考虑。第 <span class='gold'><<= $RobinTemple.exam_day + 7>></span> 天后再去房间询问。
          <</language>></li>
        <<case 'member'>>
          <li><<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              Robin has a place in the temple quarters. You can work together during the evening shift.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              罗宾在神殿宿舍有自己的位置。晚间值班时可以一起做事。
          <</language>></li>
          <li><<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
                On school-free weekdays, you can invite Robin from <<his>> room to help at the temple between 09:00 and 16:00. You can also go together after 17:00. Robin helps with the Sunday service.
              <<option 'CN'>>
                不上学的工作日，09:00 至 16:00 可以到罗宾房间约<<him>>去神殿帮忙。17:00 后也可以同行。罗宾会协助星期日弥撒。
            <</language>></li>
          <<if !(maplebirch.get('VP') and maplebirch.VP.realEstate.residenceOf('Robin'))>>
            <li><<lanSwitch 'Robin stays overnight at the temple on Saturday.' '罗宾星期六夜里会留宿神殿。'>></li>
          <</if>>
          <<if $RobinTemple.penance_day gte 0>>
            <li><<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
                The temple work ends on day <span class='red'><<= $RobinTemple.penance_day>></span>. Complete three evening shifts together, then return to the temple quarters.
              <<option 'CN'>>
                神殿安排的工作在第 <span class='red'><<= $RobinTemple.penance_day>></span> 天结束。先陪罗宾完成三个晚间班次，再去神殿宿舍。
            <</language>></li>
            <li><<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
                Evening shifts completed: <span class='teal'><<= $RobinTemple.penance_service>></span>/3
              <<option 'CN'>>
                已完成的晚间班次：<span class='teal'><<= $RobinTemple.penance_service>></span>/3
            <</language>></li>
          <<elseif $robinromance is 1 and $RobinTemple.service gte 3>>
            <li><<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
                Ask Robin about making a promise during an evening shift. Jordan will weigh both your contributions, your shared work and Robin’s conviction.
              <<option 'CN'>>
                晚间值班时可以和罗宾谈承诺仪式。约旦会分别考虑你们的神殿贡献、共同完成的工作，以及罗宾对誓言的信念。
            <</language>></li>
          <<else>>
            <li><<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
                Shared temple shifts: <span class='teal'><<= $RobinTemple.service>></span>/3
              <<option 'CN'>>
                已一起完成的神殿值班：<span class='teal'><<= $RobinTemple.service>></span>/3
            <</language>></li>
          <</if>>
        <<case 'approved'>>
          <li><<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              Jordan approved the rite. Meet Robin in the temple quarters in the evening.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              约旦批准了仪式。傍晚去神殿宿舍见罗宾。
          <</language>></li>
        <<case 'promised'>>
          <<if $templePromised is 'Sydney'>>
            <li><<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
                The temple records promises with Robin and Sydney. Jordan will examine all three vows together.
              <<option 'CN'>>
                神殿记录着你与罗宾、悉尼立下的承诺。约旦会一起检查三人的誓言。
            <</language>></li>
          <<else>>
            <li><<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
                Your promise to Robin is recognised by the temple. Jordan will examine your vows together.
              <<option 'CN'>>
                神殿见证了你和罗宾的承诺。约旦会一同检查你们的誓言。
            <</language>></li>
          <</if>>
          <li><<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              Days until the next examination: <span class='gold'><<= Math.max(0, $temple_chastity_timer)>></span>
            <<option 'CN'>>
              距离下次检查还有：<span class='gold'><<= Math.max(0, $temple_chastity_timer)>></span>
          <</language>></li>
      <</switch>>
      <<if $RobinTemple.vigil_result is 'passed'>>
        <li><<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            You led Robin through the vigil. Robin joined the monks beside you.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            你带罗宾走过守夜。罗宾与你一同晋升为修士。
        <</language>></li>
      <<elseif $temple_rank is 'initiate'
        and $RobinTemple.vigil_day gte Time.days>>
        <li><<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            You and Robin arranged to attempt the vigil on day <span class='gold'><<= $RobinTemple.vigil_day>></span>. Prepare with Robin on two separate days before Sunday at 20:00. Preparation: <span class='teal'><<= $RobinTemple.vigil_readiness>></span>/20.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            你与罗宾约好在第 <span class='gold'><<= $RobinTemple.vigil_day>></span> 天参加守夜。星期日 20:00 前，至少在两个不同的日子陪罗宾准备。准备程度：<span class='teal'><<= $RobinTemple.vigil_readiness>></span>/20。
        <</language>></li>
      <<elseif $temple_rank is 'initiate'
        and $RobinTemple.vigil_result is 'failed'>>
        <li><<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Your joint vigil failed. Speak with Robin, then arrange another attempt for a later Sunday while you are both initiates.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            你与罗宾未能通过守夜。先与罗宾谈谈，再趁你们仍是见习教徒时另约一个星期日。
        <</language>></li>
      <<elseif ['monk', 'priest'].includes($temple_rank)
        and $RobinTemple.vigil_result isnot 'passed'
        and ['member', 'approved', 'promised'].includes($RobinTemple.stage)>>
        <li><<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            You have already passed your own vigil. Robin cannot join you in a second trial and remains an initiate.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            你已经通过自己的守夜，不能再次参加同一场试炼。罗宾仍是见习教徒。
        <</language>></li>
      <</if>>
      <<if $RobinTemple.joint_sydney_penance>>
        <li><<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Work with Robin and Sydney on three separate days, then return after day <span class='red'><<= $RobinTemple.penance_day>></span> to renew the broken vows.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            与罗宾、悉尼在三个不同的日子完成工作，第 <span class='red'><<= $RobinTemple.penance_day>></span> 天后再去重新立誓。
        <</language>></li>
        <li><<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Shared shifts completed: <span class='teal'><<= $RobinTemple.penance_service>></span>/3
          <<option 'CN'>>
            已完成的共同值班：<span class='teal'><<= $RobinTemple.penance_service>></span>/3
        <</language>></li>
      <</if>>
      <<if $RobinTemple.faith_transition isnot ''>>
        <li><<lanSwitch 'Robin has something to say about the temple. Listen next time you pray together.' '罗宾有些关于神殿的想法想告诉你。下次一起祈祷时可以听听。'>></li>
      <</if>>
      <<if $RobinTemple.hospital_stage isnot ''>>
        <li><<lanSwitch 'Your hospital visit with Robin is unfinished. You can continue it at the hospital entrance.' '罗宾陪同的这次就诊尚未结束。可以在医院门口继续。'>></li>
      <</if>>
      <<if C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction gt 0>>
        <li><<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Robin’s temple conviction: <span class='teal'><<= C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction>></span>/200
          <<option 'CN'>>
            罗宾的神殿信念：<span class='teal'><<= C.npc.Robin.revelationConviction>></span>/200
        <</language>></li>
      <</if>>
      <<if ['member', 'approved', 'promised'].includes($RobinTemple.stage)>>
        <li><<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Robin's temple contribution: <span class='teal'><<= $RobinTemple.grace>></span>/100.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            罗宾的神殿贡献：<span class='teal'><<= $RobinTemple.grace>></span>/100。
        <</language>></li>
        <<if maplebirch.get('Robin')>>
          <li><<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              Temple duties add <span class='gold'>£<<= $RobinTemple.grace * 10>></span> to Robin's weekly income. This is included in <<his>> business and rent accounts.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              神殿事务为罗宾带来每周 <span class='gold'>£<<= $RobinTemple.grace * 10>></span> 的津贴，计入<<his>>的经营收入与房租结算。
          <</language>></li>
        <</if>>
      <</if>>
      <<if $temple_spear_mission is 1 and !$RobinTemple.spear_seen>>
        <li><<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Robin has heard about Jordan’s spear mission. Speak to Robin at the temple bench before setting out.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            罗宾听说了约旦交代的取矛任务。出发前，可以在神殿长椅与罗宾谈谈。
        <</language>></li>
      <<elseif $temple_spear_mission gte 2 and $RobinTemple.spear_seen and !$RobinTemple.spear_return_seen>>
        <li><<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            You promised to tell Robin how the spear journey went. Find <<him>> at the temple bench.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            你答应把取矛的经过告诉罗宾。去神殿长椅找<<him>>。
        <</language>></li>
      <</if>>
    </ul>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>
